5,1,1,talk,Servas,,Let us begin. I believe we should look at the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts to avoid repeating old mistakes.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think we should check the capital budget and software allowance. And maybe vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work, just to be safe.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I want to know about network coverage at customer plants! And maybe in-house developer availability, so we don't get stuck later!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will look into misrouted deliveries in the incident logs and time lost to copying existing records. We need to see where the actual waste is.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I'll investigate staffing of the coordination group and in-house developer availability. We cannot ignore who is actually going to do the work.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, your caution regarding the budget is wise. @Ryuji, focusing on the floor's reality is a necessary balance to our ambitions.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,Thank you... I just don't want us to find out later that we can't actually pay for what we choose.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Asuka, you're looking at developers too! Maybe we can compare notes on if we have enough people to actually build something cool!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,Logic dictates that a project is only valuable if it solves a recurring failure. The incident logs will provide that evidence.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,Exactly. A great idea is useless if the staff are already at a breaking point. I'll see if there's any breathing room.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a comprehensive plan. We are covering history, finance, infrastructure, operational waste, and human capacity.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm excited! Let's see what we find!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,pass,Ryuji,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. Let us proceed to the investigation.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
